Original C implementation generated with OpenAI Codex assistance, from the
DistQLDPC CC mathematical contracts and its own GPL source; no Qubitserf source
copied. Connected-cluster completeness: Dumer,Kovalev,Pryadko,IEEE TIT63(7),2017,
as credited in DistQLDPC src/cc/cc_half.h. Stabilizer-overlap inequality follows
the native GH-138/Lee arXiv:2610.06820 source notes; packing/charge follow native
GH-152/GH-157 with a deliberately simpler uniform integer cover bound here.
The untouched native repository's NOTICE/MODIFICATIONS remain authoritative for
its other mechanisms. No implementation of Qubitserf tie-break/BFS/erasure here.

VST: PrincetonUniversity/VST,2.14. Documentation consulted for interfaces/tactics;
this package's specifications/proofs are newly written. CompCert is a separate
verification/compiler dependency. Their sources and license terms are not
relicensed by this fork. See the repository LICENSE for the DistQLDPC components.

